      "tipo": "explicacion",
      "titulo": "A normal day",
      "texto": "For one day, use **el**: **el lunes**. For a routine, use **los**: **los sábados**. Weekdays are not capitalized.\n\nHow often: **siempre**, **a veces**, **nunca**. Before the verb, **nunca** is enough: **Nunca me levanto temprano**. After the verb, keep **no**: **No me levanto nunca temprano**.\n\nWith **yo**, many routine verbs use the reflexive pronoun **me**: **me levanto**, me ducho, me visto."
